  "plain": "In 1996 in Varginha, a town in Brazil where, by many accounts on the show, a strange creature was captured, about a dozen people in the town square told of different things they had seen, and a couple of them described military activity like nothing they had seen before, with military trucks everywhere. James Fox, a UFO documentary maker who went to Varginha and interviewed the witnesses himself, tells Michels this; if true, it would mean the army was busy in town at the very time of the reported sighting."
